      "text": "Definica is designed to connect pooled ETH staking through StakeWise Vault infrastructure with osETH liquidity and Aave V3 Ethereum supply positions represented by aEthosETH. Together, these components create the foundation for liquidity locks, protocol incentives, and future borrowing markets for approved ETH-correlated collaterals.",
